Using a reliable taxi service API, here are the available options (all one-way, for up to 5 passengers + bags; prices include taxes/fees but may vary slightly with traffic or add-ons). These are from trusted providers like Sixt Ride and Talixo, with meet-and-greet service where noted. Bookings can be confirmed via their apps/websites using the details provided.

